-- SWITCH ------------------------------------------------ main.franco.kl  K0925

`switch` w `case X ->` wel arms `x => …` men loghat tanya. Kalam beyetfarra3 3ala el qeema b `hasab`, w satr `lama pattern:` l kol far3.

2│     switch n {
       ^^^^^^^^^^

Garrab: `hasab n:
        lama 0: rag3 "zero"`

Mosa3da: Ekteb `hasab x:` w ta7taha, maza7a, `lama pattern: natiga` l kol far3. W esta5dem `_` ka pattern l "ay 7aga tanya". `kalam fix` bey3mel keda lak.

E3raf aktar: kalam explain K0925
